Objective: 
Find the file from the server with given info : user, group, type, size.

Commands used:
ls - list contents.
ls -la - list all contents.
find / -type f -user bandit7 -group bandit6 -size 33c - finds files matching the given info so file type, user, group and file size
  / means root directory not home but root -size 33c means 33 bytes.
cat /var/lib/dpkg/info/bandit7.password - Checks the file contents.

